# What pub publishes: everything git tracks, plus the prebuilt native binaries, minus the
# Rust build tree, the tests and the tooling.
#
# A `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` for pub rather than adding to it, so every pattern that
# keeps scratch output out of git is repeated here — the 0.0.5 dry run was 65 MB without them.
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
coverage/
native/target/
native/prebuilt/**/*.d
test/
tool/
Makefile

# Scratch output: keybox, Chrome, downloads
*.crdownload
*.part
*.7z
*.zip
*.tar.*
tmp*
Key BOX*
output/
out/
dist/
AUDIT.md
